{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached then grab it, check properties, do specific task; If not visible then approach, move, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = Move    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
